        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/02/withings-unveils-more-affordable-smart-scale-with-body-scanning-feature-details-here/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/withings-bodyfit-scale.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p>Withings is making its body scanning feature more affordable with the new BodyFit smart scale. This mid-range model offers features similar to the pricier Body Scan model, but for a lower starting price. </p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-health,withings\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1054057\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/02/withings-unveils-more-affordable-smart-scale-with-body-scanning-feature-details-here/#more-1054057\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
