        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/01/leaker-reveals-new-iphone-ultra-feature-release-timing-update/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/03/iphone-fold-mockup-blue.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p>Weibo leaker Fixed Focus Digital has <a href=\"https://weibo.com/5821279480/5305111967695451\">shared a new post</a> about the iPhone Ultra today that reveals a feature not rumored before—a vapor chamber—alongside a release timing update.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"iphone,iphone-ultra\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1054020\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/01/leaker-reveals-new-iphone-ultra-feature-release-timing-update/#more-1054020\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
