        "content_text": "<a href=\"https://www.kcra.com/article/tim-payne-world-cup-new-zealand-social-media-fame/71461934\">'Least-known' World Cup player Tim Payne becomes a social media hero</a> \"New Zealand defender Tim Payne has become an unlikely soccer superstar after an influencer from Argentina called on his followers to unite and make the little-known 32-year-old Payne a \"hero\" of the upcoming World Cup. Now there's <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/49gyTsZNm5U\">even a song supporting Payne</a>, who recently made his 50th appearance for New Zealand after making his debut at 18. \"<br/><br/>[bonus <a href=\"https://www.lanacion.com.ar/deportes/futbol/que-se-sabe-de-tim-payne-el-futbolista-neozelandes-que-se-hizo-viral-a-dias-de-que-arranque-el-nid01062026/\">link</a> in spanish]",
        "type": "Internet",
