        "content_text": "<a href=\"https://www.thethiefoftales.com/\">The Thief of Tales</a> is a complete fantasy webcomic by <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/zazb.bsky.social\">Guillaume Bonnet</a> and <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/evebolt.bsky.social\">Eve Bolt</a>. A woman flees from her pursuers into an enchanted forest full of beasts, monsters and stories. A quick binge at 352 pages with relatively light dialogue, gentle pace and excellent art. <a href=\"https://www.thethiefoftales.com/more-lore/\">Supplementary materials</a> are available for those who want more.",
