        "content_text": "From cask to car, could red wine be Australia's next fuel? <a href=\"https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-05-17/wine-oversupply-to-fuel-demand-petrol-cars-high-prices/106638346\">Australia's wine industry is investigating whether its current 263 million litre glut of wine would be better used as biofuel to power cars, trucks or even aircraft.</a>",
