        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/29/apple-tvs-latest-sci-fi-series-is-a-winner-and-just-the-start-of-exciting-new-direction/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/apple-tv-logo-lg-stars.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p><a href=\"https://tv.apple.com/channel/tvs.sbd.4000?itscg=30200&amp;itsct=tv%5C_box%5C_link&amp;at=1000l3cvR\">Apple TV</a> premiered its latest sci-fi series <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/29/for-all-mankind-spinoff-series-star-city-premieres-on-apple-tv/\">today</a>: Star City. It’s the first of several spinoffs to existing shows that are in the works. Here’s why I’m excited for what it represents for the future of Apple TV.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-tv\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1053815\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/29/apple-tvs-latest-sci-fi-series-is-a-winner-and-just-the-start-of-exciting-new-direction/#more-1053815\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
