        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/ai-artifact-catalogs-durable-standards-worth-institutional-investment/",
        "content_text": "Companies everywhere are trying to leverage AI to boost internal productivity metrics. Some, like Ramp and Intercom, are succeeding. Many are failing. To make matters more complicated, the narrative around what tooling enables these gains is constantly shifting. For software engineers, auto-complete via GitHub Copilot was the bleeding-edge tool of choice in 2024. Then it [&#8230;]",
        "type": "Technology",
